sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SDK as kubeflow SDK<br/>(workbench process)
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TC as Trainer Controller<br/>status URL (HTTPS)
    participant Pod as TrainJob Pod<br/>metrics 28080/TCP HTTP
    participant PyPI as PyPI / AIPCC index<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SO as Spark Operator
    participant SC as Spark Connect Server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SDK,S3: Flow 1 - Submit RHAI TrainJob (TrainingHubTrainer / TransformersTrainer)
    SDK->>API: List ClusterTrainingRuntimes<br/>TLS, SA bearer token
    API-->>SDK: Runtimes
    SDK->>API: Read Data Connection Secret (keys only)<br/>TLS, SA bearer token
    SDK->>API: Create TrainJob (generated script + progression annotations)<br/>TLS, SA bearer token
    API-->>TC: TrainJob reconciled -> pods created
    Pod->>PyPI: pip install (default pypi.org/simple)<br/>TLS, no auth
    TC->>Pod: GET progress on 28080<br/>plain HTTP, no auth
    Pod->>TC: POST status<br/>TLS (controller CA), projected SA token
    Pod->>S3: Write checkpoints / outputs<br/>TLS (optionally unverified), S3 access keys
    SDK->>API: Watch TrainJob, read pod logs and events<br/>TLS, SA bearer token

    Note over SDK,SC: Flow 2 - Interactive Spark Connect session
    SDK->>API: Create SparkConnect CR<br/>TLS, bearer token
    API-->>SO: Reconcile -> Spark Connect pod + Service
    alt In-cluster
        SDK->>SC: gRPC sc://svc.ns.svc.cluster.local:15002<br/>plaintext, no auth
    else Off-cluster
        SDK->>API: kubectl port-forward (SPDY tunnel)<br/>TLS to API server, kubeconfig
        API->>SC: Tunnel to pod 15002
        Note over SDK: Client connects to sc://127.0.0.1:local-port
    end

    Note over SDK,MR: Flow 3 - Register model
    SDK->>S3: Upload model files<br/>TLS, S3 access keys
    SDK->>MR: Register model + version (REST)<br/>TLS (optional custom CA), Bearer user_token
    MR-->>SDK: RegisteredModel / ModelVersion
